  "content": "\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/738/500/title.png\"></strong></span>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@FurtiTwo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/985/youtube-png.png\" width=\"19%\" height=\"19%\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/k3fGJwJqzu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/987/discord-png.png\" width=\"19%\" height=\"19%\"></a><a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/furtitwo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/988/donate-png.png\" width=\"22%\" height=\"22%\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/furti_two/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/986/curseforge-png.png\" width=\"19%\" height=\"19%\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/furti-two\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/984/modrinth-png.png\" width=\"19%\" height=\"19%\"></a></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>这里是“无用之剑”模组，本模组为 1.16 版本添加了 76 把新剑，为 1.15 版本添加了 60 把新剑，为 1.14 版本添加了 59 把新剑，为 1.12 版本添加了 51 把新剑！</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><br></strong></span></p>\n\n**以下是剑的列表：**\n\n![](https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/738/501/image1.png)\n\n“无用之剑”模组兼容 Aquaculture、Create、Alex's Mobs、Druidcraft、Botania、Update Aquatic、Savage and Ravage、Endergetic Expansion 以及 Twilight Forest（可选依赖）。  \n![](https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/738/502/image2.png)  \n\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/330/43/uselessswordrecipe.png\" alt=\"upload_2020-12-28_15-54-56.png\" width=\"1117\" height=\"561\"></p></div>\n\n <div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>Max Covs 制作的西班牙语模组展示：</strong></span></div>\n\n<div><p><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/wN2lz60GuSE?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></p></div>\n\n **您可以将“无用之剑”模组放入您的整合包中**",
